  "description": [
    {
      "ja": "自分だけのファンタジージョブを創り出すことが出来る新プラモデルシリーズ『30 MINUTES FANTASY』より、「30MF アイテムショップ1 (ナイトオプション)」が登場！",
      "en": "\"30MF Item Shop 1 (Night Option)\" is now available from the new plastic model series \" 30 MINUTES FANTASY\" where you can create your own fantasy job!"
    },
    {
      "ja": "• “アーマークロス”［装甲換装］の幅を広げる武装やアイテムが詰まったセット。",
      "en": "• A set packed with weapons and items that expand the range of “Armor Cloth” [Armor Replacement]."
    },
    {
      "ja": "• フェイスや肩、胸アーマーのパーツは2種類のデザインのものが付属。",
      "en": "• Two different designs of face, shoulder, and chest armor parts are included."
    },
    {
      "ja": "• ナイトの装備より軽量タイプのシールドが付属。",
      "en": "• Comes with Seal, which is lighter than the knight's equipment."
    },
    {
      "ja": "• 「宝箱」と「ポーション」はグレーとクリアブルーの2種類が付属。「宝箱」は蓋を開閉可能。",
      "en": "• Two types of \"treasure box \" and \" potion \" are included: gray and clear blue. The \" treasure box\" has a lid that can be opened and closed."
    },
    {
      "ja": "• 30MFアイテムと別売りの30MSアイテムとのミキシングに便利な「30MS用ジョイントパーツ」が付属。",
      "en": "• \"Joint parts for 30MS\" are included, which is convenient for mixing 30MF items and 30MS items (sold separately)."
    }
  ],
